<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>每日视界 - 权威新闻，触手可及</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            background: #fff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }
        .top-bar {
            background: #1a1a2e;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 8px 0;
        }
        .top-bar .container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .top-bar a {
            color: #ccc;
            margin-left: 16px;
        }
        .top-bar a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }
        header {
            background: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .header-main {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #c0392b;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .logo span {
            color: #1a1a2e;
        }
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .nav a {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #333;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .nav a:hover {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #c0392b;
        }
        .nav a.active {
            color: #c0392b;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .search-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .search-box input {
            border: none;
            background: none;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            width: 140px;
        }
        .search-box svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .hero-section {
            padding: 32px 0;
        }
        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .hero-main {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 420px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding: 40px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .hero-main:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .hero-main .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #c0392b;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            width: fit-content;
        }
        .hero-main h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .hero-main p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .hero-main .meta {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .hero-side {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .hero-card {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .hero-card:hover {
            border-color: #c0392b;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(192,57,43,0.08);
        }
        .hero-card .tag {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #c0392b;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .hero-card h3 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .hero-card .meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 40px 0 24px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a2e;
        }
        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 14px;
        }
        .section-title h2::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 4px;
            height: 24px;
            background: #c0392b;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .section-title a {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
        }
        .section-title a:hover {
            color: #c0392b;
        }
        .news-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .news-card {
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .news-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .news-card .thumb {
            height: 180px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 48px;
        }
        .news-card .thumb.finance {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
        }
        .news-card .thumb.tech {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
        }
        .news-card .thumb.society {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe, #00f2fe);
        }
        .news-card .thumb.world {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #43e97b, #38f9d7);
        }
        .news-card .thumb.health {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a, #fee140);
        }
        .news-card .thumb.sports {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a18cd1, #fbc2eb);
        }
        .news-card .content {
            padding: 16px;
        }
        .news-card .tag {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #c0392b;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .news-card h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .news-card p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .news-card .meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .two-col {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 32px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .list-news .item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .list-news .item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .list-news .item .num {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #e8e8e8;
            min-width: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .list-news .item:nth-child(1) .num { color: #c0392b; }
        .list-news .item:nth-child(2) .num { color: #e67e22; }
        .list-news .item:nth-child(3) .num { color: #f39c12; }
        .list-news .item .info h4 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .list-news .item .info .meta {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .sidebar-widget {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .sidebar-widget h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .sidebar-widget h3::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -2px;
            left: 0;
            width: 40px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #c0392b;
        }
        .sidebar-widget .hot-item {
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .sidebar-widget .hot-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .sidebar-widget .hot-item h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .sidebar-widget .hot-item .meta {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
        }
        .subscribe-box {
            background: #1a1a2e;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .subscribe-box h4 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .subscribe-box p {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .subscribe-box form {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .subscribe-box input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
        }
        .subscribe-box button {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            background: #c0392b;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .subscribe-box button:hover {
            background: #a93226;
        }
        footer {
            background: #1a1a2e;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding: 48px 0 24px;
        }
        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }
        .footer-grid h4 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .footer-grid p {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .footer-grid ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .footer-grid ul li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .footer-grid ul li a {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .footer-grid ul li a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }
        .footer-bottom {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            padding-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
        }
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero-main {
                min-height: 300px;
            }
            .news-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            .two-col {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .footer-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
            .nav {
                display: none;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .news-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero-main h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="top-bar">
        <div class="container">
            <span>2025年1月15日 星期三</span>
            <div>
                <a href="finance.html">财经</a>
                <a href="tech.html">科技</a>
                <a href="about.html">关于</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-main">
                <a href="index.html" class="logo">每日<span>视界</span></a>
                <nav class="nav">
                    <a href="index.html" class="active">首页</a>
                    <a href="finance.html">财经</a>
                    <a href="tech.html">科技</a>
                    <a href="index.html#society">社会</a>
                    <a href="index.html#world">国际</a>
                    <a href="about.html">关于我们</a>
                </nav>
                <div class="search-box">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
                        <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
                    </svg>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="搜索新闻...">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="hero-grid">
                    <a href="article.html" class="hero-main">
                        <span class="tag">深度报道</span>
                        <h1>央行宣布下调存款准备金率0.5个百分点 释放长期流动性约1.2万亿元</h1>
                        <p>此次降准旨在加大对实体经济的支持力度，降低社会综合融资成本，推动经济持续回升向好。多家机构预计后续还有进一步降息空间。</p>
                        <span class="meta">每日视界 · 2025年1月15日 09:15 · 阅读量 128.6万</span>
                    </a>
                    <div class="hero-side">
                        <a href="article.html" class="hero-card">
                            <span class="tag">科技</span>
                            <h3>国产大模型突破：新一代AI推理引擎推理速度提升400%，功耗降低60%</h3>
                            <span class="meta">2025年1月15日 08:30</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="hero-card">
                            <span class="tag">社会</span>
                            <h3>全国多地启动2025年春运保障 预计跨区域人员流动量超90亿人次</h3>
                            <span class="meta">2025年1月15日 07:45</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="hero-card">
                            <span class="tag">国际</span>
                            <h3>多国央行联合发布稳定币监管框架 明确跨境支付合规路径</h3>
                            <span class="meta">2025年1月14日 22:10</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <h2>要闻速览</h2>
                    <a href="finance.html">更多新闻 →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="news-grid">
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb finance">📊</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">财经</div>
                            <h3>A股三大指数集体收涨 半导体板块领涨 北向资金净流入超80亿元</h3>
                            <p>今日A股市场情绪明显回暖，上证指数涨1.2%收复3300点关口。半导体、AI算力等科技板块表现活跃，多只个股涨停。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月15日 15:32</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb tech">🔬</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">科技</div>
                            <h3>量子计算新突破：我国科学家实现105比特量子纠缠态制备</h3>
                            <p>研究团队在超导量子处理器上成功实现了105个量子比特的纠缠态制备，刷新了国内纪录，为实用化量子计算迈出关键一步。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月15日 11:20</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb society">🏥</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">社会</div>
                            <h3>国家医保局：2025年新增120种药品纳入医保目录 抗癌药降幅最高达55%</h3>
                            <p>新一批医保目录调整结果公布，涉及肿瘤、罕见病、慢性病等多个治疗领域，预计每年可为患者节省用药支出超百亿元。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月15日 10:45</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb world">🌍</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">国际</div>
                            <h3>联合国气候峰会达成新协议：2030年全球可再生能源装机翻倍</h3>
                            <p>经过两周密集谈判，与会195个国家就新一轮气候行动路线图达成一致，重点聚焦能源转型和绿色融资机制。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月14日 23:40</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb health">💊</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">健康</div>
                            <h3>冬季流感高峰持续 疾控专家提醒：高危人群应尽早完成疫苗接种</h3>
                            <p>全国流感监测数据显示本周阳性率持续攀升，以甲型H1N1为主。专家建议老人、儿童及慢性病患者优先接种。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月14日 18:20</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                    <a href="article.html" class="news-card">
                        <div class="thumb sports">⚽</div>
                        <div class="content">
                            <div class="tag">体育</div>
                            <h3>中超冬窗引援大战白热化：五家俱乐部豪掷2亿引进外援</h3>
                            <p>2025赛季中超联赛备战进入冲刺阶段，多支球队在冬季转会窗口完成重磅引援，外援竞争趋于白热化。</p>
                            <div class="meta">2025年1月14日 16:55</div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="container two-col">
                <div>
                    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:0;">
                        <h2>热读排行</h2>
                        <a href="tech.html">科技频道 →</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-news">
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">1</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>华为发布新一代折叠屏手机：展开尺寸7.9英寸 内置AI摄影系统</h4>
                                <div class="meta">科技 · 2025年1月14日 · 96.2万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">2</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>2025年政府工作报告亮点速读：GDP目标增长5%左右 新增3000万个城镇岗位</h4>
                                <div class="meta">财经 · 2025年1月14日 · 88.7万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">3</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>SpaceX星舰完成第七次试飞 成功回收超重型助推器 首次部署卫星载荷</h4>
                                <div class="meta">科技 · 2025年1月14日 · 74.3万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">4</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>教育部：2025年起全面实施中小学人工智能课程 覆盖所有学段</h4>
                                <div class="meta">教育 · 2025年1月13日 · 62.1万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">5</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>新能源汽车12月销量创新高 单月突破150万辆 渗透率首破50%</h4>
                                <div class="meta">财经 · 2025年1月13日 · 58.9万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">6</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>北京、上海、深圳三城同日宣布取消住房限购 释放刚需购房群体</h4>
                                <div class="meta">社会 · 2025年1月13日 · 55.4万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
                            <div class="num">7</div>
                            <div class="info">
                                <h4>国产CPU芯片量产突破：性能达到国际主流水平 已适配主流操作系统</h4>
                                <div class="meta">科技 · 2025年1月12日 · 49.8万阅读</div>
                            </div>
                        </a>
                        <a href="article.html" class="item">
